# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CrashDash Marketing — repository hygiene
#
# This repository is a PUBLIC-FACING static marketing site. Nothing here may
# reference, import or depend on any private system.
#
# Rule of thumb: if it is generated, local, or machine-specific, it does not
# belong in this repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Operating system noise -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE state -----------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs and debug output --------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Local scratch (never commit) -------------------------------------------
/scratch/
/notes/
/tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak

# --- Dependency / build output (only if a build step is ever introduced) ----
node_modules/
dist/

# --- Windows alternate-data-stream artefacts --------------------------------
# Files copied from a Windows volume can carry a ":Zone.Identifier" sidecar.
*:Zone.Identifier

# --- Supplied working input (never publish) ---------------------------------
# The landing-page pack is design input supplied for a build, not site output.
# It carries briefs, the master prompt and reference mock-ups, is several MB of
# imagery, and must not be published from a repository that is public-facing.
/crashdash-landing-pack/
build/
.cache/

# --- Environment and secret material (must never exist here) ----------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
